This project tracks requirements for "verified-logic". The requirements are defined in docs/*.md and are referenced in code using r[...] annotations (for example, r[verified-logic.some-requirement]).
The implementation being checked: rust.

verified-logic/rust: 1943 of 1943 requirements are covered. 1943 of 1943 have a verification reference.

